kout very brutally, it is up to you.\n\nHere are two references:\n\nThis one is for pose:\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/107850452#big_2\n\nAnd this is for working out:\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/107356292#big_0\n\nI would like her to be fully visible from head to toes so her very muscular legs are visible too.\n\nIf you have other idea or would you like to change, it is up to you!\n\nThank you!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@duelist_rui/works/59", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cb61d932/uploads/origins/097bf85c-3c6d-41ac-9c54-a6138195bc71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=eadff874744bc372de4810cff9958b5a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cb61d932/uploads/origins/097bf85c-3c6d-41ac-9c54-a6138195bc71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=eadff874744bc372de4810cff9958b5a, https://si.imgix.net/cb61d932/uploads/origins/097bf85c-3c6d-41ac-9c54-a6138195bc71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f24498e476a95fdbf84218c6ed2910db 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cb61d932/uploads/origins/097bf85c-3c6d-41ac-9c54-a6138195bc71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d4cf4c3a037e3d9622bb4075a2241738 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@duelist_rui/works/58", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f74e66d7/uploads/origins/d6259641-ed9b-4ede-9afd-b05924d3f18e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=5